title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6 + austerity_fortimers
card-image: img/Mann_der_Arbeit.jpg
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the SPD runs a social world onto itself.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the SPD is a social world onto itself, with a vast array of associated organizations which serve the social needs of their members from cradle to grave.

- @newspapers: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @welfare: Fund more mutual aid and welfare programs.
- @culture: Fund sports leagues, educational, and cultural programs.
- @reichsbanner: Fund the Reichsbanner, our self-defense organization.
- @youth: We have the reputation of being a party for old men. Support the youth organizations.
- @agriculture: Assist the agricultural regions.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@agriculture
view-if: landvolk_fury > 0 or year < 1928 or (year >= 1928 and month <= 5)
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: {!
    Q.resources -= 1;
    Q.addEventNudge('rural', 'spd', (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 7 : 5);
    Q.addEventNudge('rural', 'dnvp', -5);
    Q.addEventNudge('rural', 'dvp', -2);
    Q.addEventNudge('rural', 'other', -8);
    Q.agricultural_assist += 1;
    if (Q.landvolk_fury > 0) { Q.landvolk_suppress += 1; }
    Q.reformist_dissent += (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 2 : 5;
!}

We have assisted the agricultural sector, most neglected by the previous government. [? if year >= 1928: This is especially in the wake of agricultural revolts and protests caused by the Landvolkbewegung and multiple decentralized organizations. ?]

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: {!
    Q.resources -= 1;
    Q.media_timer = 0;
!}
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.

@welfare
choose-if: (resources > 0 and not spd_in_government and labor_minister_party != "SPD") or (resources > 2 and spd_in_government and labor_minister_party = "SPD")
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: [? if not spd_in_government and labor_minister_party != "SPD": -1 resources ?] [? if spd_in_government and labor_minister_party = "SPD": -3 resources ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.resources -= 1;
    if (Q.spd_in_government && Q.labor_minister_party === "SPD") { Q.resources -= 2; }
    Q.workers_aid += 1;
    Q.addEventNudge('unemployedc', 'spd', 5 * (1 - Q.dissent));
    if (Q.spd_in_government && Q.labor_minister_party === "SPD") { Q.welfare += 1; }
    if (Q.welfare > 0) {
        Q.addEventNudge('workers', 'spd', 3);
        Q.addEventNudge('unemployedc', 'spd', 3);
    }
!}

We have increased funding to Workers' Welfare. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

[? if spd_in_government and labor_minister_party = "SPD": Since we control the government and labor ministry, this effectively increases welfare. ?]

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: {!
    Q.resources -= 1;
    Q.cultural_organizations += 1;
    Q.left_dissent -= (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 3 : 6;
    Q.labor_dissent -= (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 4 : 6;
    Q.center_dissent -= (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 3 : 6;
    Q.reformist_dissent -= (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 9 : 6;
    Q.neorevisionist_dissent -= (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 8 : 6;
    Q.center_strength += 5;
!}

It is not enough for the SPD to solely be a political party. The Worker Singer's League, Worker's Sports, and our schools and libraries are crucial to our members' lives. Funding these organizations makes our members more committed to the party, even when our policies might not be to their liking.

[? if sa_strength > 500 or sh_strength > 1000: However, it feels frivolous to spend on sports and choirs when the fascists are murdering us in the streets. ?]

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: {!
    Q.resources -= 1;
    Q.rb_strength += 50;
    Q.rb_militancy += 0.02;
    Q.young_socialists += 1;
    Q.left_strength += (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 2 : 5;
    Q.neorevisionist_strength += (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 7 : 5;
    Q.reformist_strength += (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 3 : 0;
    Q.radicalization += (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 0.5 : 1;
    Q.socialism += (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 0 : 1;
    Q.labor_dissent += (Q.peoples_party === 1) ? 2 : 0;
    Q.workers_z *= 0.99;
    Q.workers_ddp *= 0.98;
    Q.workers_dvp *= 0.97;
    Q.workers_dnvp *= 0.95;
    Q.workers_nsdap *= 0.96;
    Q.workers_bvp *= 0.97;
    Q.workers_wp *= 0.90;
    Q.workers_kpd *= 1.02;
    Q.workers_spd *= 1.03;
!}

Our new youth members flock to the left or neorevisionist wings of the party, and also bring new radicalism to the Reichsbanner. Additionally, workerist class (of course, youth) radicalizes to the left side, siding with bourgeuoise or reactionaries far less frequently. [? if peoples_party >= 1: With our expansion of the base, it seems, that radical rhetoric is not effective anymore. ?]

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
